Design and implement a Ride Sharing Service that allows riders to request rides, drivers to accept trips, and the system to manage trip 
assignments, payments, and trip status.

Person interface

User class

Rider class

TripStatus

Trip

UberSystem class
    -> allow users to request ride
    -> allow riders to accept ride
    -> manage trips
    -> manage payments

=======================================

Location:
    -latitude : Integer
    -longitude: Integer

Person<<Interface>>:
    +getName() : string
    +getPhoneNo(): phoneNo
    +getLocation(): Location

Rider implements Person:
    -name: string
    -id: String
    -phoneNo: string
    -location: Location
    +updateLocation() : void

Driver implements Person:
    -name: string
    -id: String
    -phoneNo: string
    -location: Location
    +updateLocation() : void

PaymentMethod enum:
    CARD, UPI

TripStatus:
    REQUESTED, CANCELED, ASSIGNED, STARTED, COMPLETED

PaymentStatus:
    PENDING, COMPLETED

Trip:
    -rider: Rider
    -id: String
    -location: Location
    -driver: Driver
    -amount: BigDecimal
    -paymentMethod: PaymentMethod
    -status: TripStatus

PaymentStrategy:
    +pay(BigDecimal amt) : boolean

CardPayment:
    +pay(BigDecimal amt) : boolean

UpiPayment:
    +pay(BigDecimal amt) : boolean

PaymentProcessor:
    +pay(Trip trip, BigDecimal amt)

UberSystem:
    -riderTrips : Map<String, Set<String>> // riderId -> Set<tripId>
    -driverTrips: Map<String, Set<String>> // driverId -> Set<driverId>
    -trips : Map<String, Trip> // tripId -> Trip object
    -riders: Map<String, Rider> //riderId -> Rider
    -drivers: Map<String, Driver> //driverId -> Driver

    +addDriver(Driver d) : void
    +addRider(Rider r) : void
    +requestTrip(String riderId, Trip trip) : boolean
    +cancelTrip(String riderId, String tripId) : boolean
    +acceptTrip(String driverId, String tripId) : boolean
    +endTrip(String driverId, String tripId): boolean //calls the PatmentProcessor class.